# Conditional patch for the latest converter's documented physical wiring ONLY.
# Verify: M5=Front Left, M6=Rear Left, M7=Front Right, M8=Rear Right.
# Requires SERVO5_FUNCTION=73 and SERVO8_FUNCTION=74 already.
# Do not apply if physical wiring is FL/FR/RL/RR.
SERVO6_FUNCTION,73
SERVO7_FUNCTION,74
